flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Navigate to /patients/create]
    B --> C{Authorized?\nAdmin or Doktor}
    C -->|No| D[403 Forbidden]
    D --> Z([End])
    C -->|Yes| E[Display create patient form]
    E --> F[Fill in patient details]
    F --> G[Submit form]
    G --> H{Validation passes?}
    H -->|No| I[Show validation errors inline]
    I --> F
    H -->|Yes| J[Patient::create persisted to DB]
    J --> K[Redirect to /patients/id]
    K --> L[Display patient profile]
    L --> M([End])
